 About: GPU 0 · NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti Laptop GPU                 
   Utilization     How busy the GPU is: the busiest engine, as in     
                   Task Manager. Games show up as 3D; AI and CUDA     
                   work as 3D or Compute. High utilization is normal  
                   while gaming or running a model.                   
   Engines         3D: games, the desktop, some AI. Compute: CUDA /   
                   AI work. Copy: moving data between RAM and the     
                   GPU, high while loading a game or model. Video     
                   Decode / Encode: watching, streaming or recording  
                   video, done by dedicated hardware.                 
   Dedicated       The GPU's own memory (VRAM). A local LLM must fit  
                   here to run fast; when it's full, data spills into 
                   shared memory over PCIe and tokens per second drop 
